::MODULE{REFERENCE_SOURCES|title:常规定价参考，不算优惠}
DigitalOcean | https://www.digitalocean.com/ | https://www.digitalocean.com/pricing/droplets |

::MODULE{EXCLUDED|title:按用户最新指示不进入抓取管线}
GoDaddy | HTTP 403 reported in the supplied research; excluded from automated collection.
Bluehost | Prices require JavaScript rendering according to the supplied research; excluded.
hosting.com (formerly A2 Hosting) | Requires rendering according to the supplied research; excluded.
Vultr | The supplied research reports /promo/ disallowed by robots.txt; excluded.

::RULE{robots.txt⇒按分组与最长匹配判断；403或不明确⇒停抓；禁止绕过挑战或反爬}
::RULE{抓不到price⇒省略price与结构化价格；无法绑定套餐、币种与条款⇒不发布}
::RULE{valid_until已过或来源本轮失败⇒不显示为当前优惠；超过fresh_hours⇒标记需要复核}
::RULE{affiliate_url为空⇒官方裸链；非空⇒清晰披露并加rel=sponsored；不设cookie不重定向注入}
::RULE{更新频率由SETTINGS.update_cron提供；workflow校验与配置一致}
::BOUNDARY{never:编优惠 编价格 编佣金 品牌词竞价 cookie注入 自买自推 买粉 刷量 规避平台条款|scope:permanent}
